The FluidPRO BFX-3 Brake Flush System from MAHLE Aftermarket Inc., Service Solutions delivers complete brake fluid exchange in a simple, three-step process, says the company.
Compatible with both ABS and non-ABS brake systems, for increased utility, the BFX-3 is easy to operate with service times of approximately 10 minutes.
Features of the BFX-3 include:
• Pistol wand for convenience and accurate fill;
• Automated push/pull process allows technicians to multi-task;
• Easy hook-up with three-step process for simple servicing;
• Complete service in less than 10 minutes for improved customer satisfaction;
• Pressure gauge to assist in brake system diagnosis;
• An LCD display indicates when new fluid cylinder is empty and used fluid tank is full; and
• Universal adapters, which designed to fit many makes and models of vehicles, enhancing service offerings.
